{"id":"1bbf751ce7a46128","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-hornminorant.md","title":"Greatest Horn minorant","display":"thm-hornminorant — Greatest Horn minorant","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-hornminorant","aliases":["27-thm-hornminorant"],"display":"thm-hornminorant — Greatest Horn minorant","depends_on":["[[27-df-hornminorant]]","[[27-df-hornfunc]]","[[27-thm-meetclosurelaws]]","[[27-thm-hornchar]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-hornminorant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-hornminorant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hornminorant — Greatest Horn minorant"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f18fe544253d997\" href=\"?note=2f18fe544253d997\" title=\"27-df-hornminorant\">27-df-hornminorant</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"946d1639a1c3cf2a\" href=\"?note=946d1639a1c3cf2a\" title=\"27-thm-meetclosurelaws\">27-thm-meetclosurelaws</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" href=\"?note=584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" title=\"27-thm-hornchar\">27-thm-hornchar</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2f18fe544253d997\" href=\"?note=2f18fe544253d997\" title=\"27-df-hornminorant\">27-df-hornminorant</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)(a)\\le f(a))\\land\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\;\\left((\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;g(a)\\le f(a))\\to\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;g(a)\\le\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)(a)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)(a)\\le f(a))\\land\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\;\\left((\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;g(a)\\le f(a))\\to\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;g(a)\\le\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)(a)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.3, Theorem 6.7，印刷页 279，PDF 第 303 页（从 1 计数）。 已核对完整证明：闭包幂等性给 Hornness；闭包扩张性给 h≤f；任一 Horn minorant g 的假点集交闭并包含 F(f)，故包含其交闭包，反转函数序得到 g≤h。这是 greatest，因此唯一。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-hornminorant","status":"resolved","id":"2f18fe544253d997","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornminorant]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-meetclosurelaws","status":"resolved","id":"946d1639a1c3cf2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-meetclosurelaws]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-hornchar","status":"resolved","id":"584eb5a4dd07e7fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornchar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornminorant","status":"resolved","id":"2f18fe544253d997","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornminorant]] and [[27-df-hornfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornminorant]] and [[27-df-hornfunc]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)(a)\\le f(a))\\land\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\;\\left((\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;g(a)\\le f(a))\\to\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;g(a)\\le\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n(f)(a)\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1345,"backlinks":[{"id":"2f18fe544253d997","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.3, Theorem 6.7，印刷页 279，PDF 第 303 页（从 1 计数）。 两支以交闭包及其在 $\\mathbb B^n$ 中的补集为定义域，直接构成唯一全函数，不再借用仅以自然语言解释的示性函数；$F(h)=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))$。最大性质在 [[27-thm-hornminorant]] 证明，不在定义中预先假定。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-440","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornminorant|thm-hornminorant — Greatest Horn minorant]]"}],"outgoing":["2f18fe544253d997","bb96ce122f7cd0ef","946d1639a1c3cf2a","584eb5a4dd07e7fb","5d10aed668d85817"]}